# Deployment credentials and data exports.
# The CI deploy keypair is generated outside the repository (see
# docs/DEPLOYMENT.md, "CI/CD credentials"); these patterns are a second line of
# defence, because a private key committed to a *public* repository is a
# production credential leak even after it is deleted from HEAD.
# waypost_data.json is the dumpdata fixture used for the SQLite -> PostgreSQL
# migration and contains every row of business data.
deploy_key*
*_deploy_key*
id_ed25519*
id_rsa*
*.ppk
known_hosts
waypost_data.json